  {
   "id": "beyond-enemy-lines-2-117082@31125",
   "gameId": "beyond-enemy-lines-2-117082",
   "displayName": "Update 31125",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-03-26T07:26:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Agents,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "a new update for Beyond Enemy Lines 2 is available. This 'small' update enabled Nvidia DLSS 2.0 features for users of Nvidia Cards. You can find the options in the Video Settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "While this update is around 1,9gb in size for just DLSS, I want to give you a short glimps of whats going on and why it's nearly 2GB in size.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm currently reorganizing the entire Asset pool. I will today start and try to merge Maps with it's improvements of the Xbox One version into the PC. This step needes some rearangement of assets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Why I'm doing this? Due to the porting process to consoles last year, each Platform has a seperate source branch with it's unique changes. This makes updating and maintaining the game nearly impossible. I will update the PC version with all Console improvements and go even further with the PC version. After this the new PC version will be brought to Xbox One and maybe Playstation 4 (the PS4 patch process is stupidly complex and fails 9 out of 10 times).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "enabled Nvidia DLSS 2.0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
