  {
   "id": "beyond-enemy-lines-2-117082@09",
   "gameId": "beyond-enemy-lines-2-117082",
   "displayName": "Update 09",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-12-12T13:30:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Stronghold is now available!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the last DLC of 2019 and the final DLC for the Warhead campaign offers a new intense singleplayer and large scale mission where you need to locate the warhead in Volkov's, by paramilitary soldiers guarded Stronghold.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Our top priority is to find that bomb! Volkov was not able to sell the warhead in time and it’s still stored in his hideout. And that’s where the issues arise, this “hideout” is a proper Stronghold guarded my paramilitary soldiers.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In early 2020 Beyond Enemy Lines 2 is back with it's final 8 mission long Addon-DLC and the return of Beyond enemy Lines 2 Multiplayer!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buy Beyond Enemy Lines 2: Stronghold now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "_______________________________________________________________",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Official Site: http://www.beyond-enemy-lines.com/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Developer: http://www.polygon-art.com/",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
